        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-26A 1-1/2\" Diameter Large Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning design door pull from the <a href=\"/collections/acrylic-collection\"><b>First Impressions Acrylic Collection</b></a>, combines the contemporary beauty of  Acrylic with Decorative  bold solid brass mounting brackets (mounting brackets weigh almost 3 lbs. each). Made in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality  door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. They are available in Crystal Clear or Frosted Acrylic. These are great pulls for <a href=\"/products/large-acrylic-glass-door-pulls-pair-first-impressions-fii-sd-cust-f\"><b>glass doors</b></a>, entry doors, any door where a bold contemporary statement is required.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions FII-26A Decorative Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14-1/2\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Finest Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This acrylic door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 5 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
