                "description": "First Impressions 26A - Acrylic Door Pull. This stunning design door pull from the Acrylic collection, combines the contemporary beauty of  Acrylic with Decorative  bold solid brass mounting brackets (mounting brackets weigh almost 3 lbs. each). Assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality innovational door pull designs. ",
